// Heartbeat: hosts that sent metrics in the last 24 hours but none in the last 15 minutes.
// Catches a stopped collector, an unreadable file for AMA, or a broken DCR even when
// JAVA_GC_COLLECTOR_FAILED never arrives. Scope: dedicated Log Analytics workspace.
// Configure: measure = table rows, condition > 0, evaluation every 5 minutes, dimension = host.
JavaGc_CL
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where record_type == "metric"
| summarize LastMetric = max(TimeGenerated) by host
| where LastMetric < ago(15m)
| project host, LastMetric, MinutesSilent = datetime_diff('minute', now(), LastMetric)
